# UI Class Names Use `UI` Prefix In Uppercase

When naming UI classes (components, adapters, flows, services, builders) ensure the `UI` prefix is uppercase and part of the PascalCase identifier.

- ✅ `class UIChannelManager`, `class UIFlowDefinitionExporter`
- ❌ `class UiChannelManager`, `class uiFlowDefinitionExporter`

Apply this everywhere in the monorepo—any UI-centric class (components, adapters, flows, services, utilities) must use the uppercase `UI` prefix to stay consistent with existing abstractions.
